.TH SONGBIRD 1 "January 2025" "songbird-orchestrator 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
songbird \- Universal service orchestration platform with legacy gaming network bridging
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B songbird
[\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR] \fI\,COMMAND\/\fR [\fI\,ARGS\/\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Songbird Orchestrator is a universal service orchestration platform focused on legacy gaming network bridging. It makes 1990s/2000s games playable over the internet as if they were on a LAN by detecting and bridging gaming protocols like IPX, DirectPlay, NetBIOS, UDP, and TCP.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print help information
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print version information
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Use verbose output
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Use quiet output (minimal logging)

.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B gaming
Gaming network bridge commands for protocol detection and session management
.TP
.B orchestrator  
Service orchestration commands for managing distributed services
.TP
.B config
Configuration management commands
.TP
.B status
Display system status and health information
.TP
.B discovery
Service discovery commands
.TP
.B init
Initialize new Songbird configuration
.TP
.B join
Join existing Songbird network
.TP
.B quick
Quick setup commands for common scenarios
.TP
.B service
Service management commands
.TP
.B firewall
Firewall configuration commands
.TP
.B logs
Log management and viewing commands
.TP
.B version
Display version information

.SH GAMING PROTOCOL SUPPORT
Songbird can detect and bridge the following gaming protocols:
.TP
.B IPX
Internetwork Packet Exchange (StarCraft, Age of Empires)
.TP
.B DirectPlay
Microsoft DirectPlay protocol (Age of Empires II, many 90s games)
.TP
.B NetBIOS
Network Basic Input/Output System (various legacy games)
.TP
.B UDP
User Datagram Protocol gaming sessions
.TP
.B TCP
Transmission Control Protocol gaming sessions

.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B songbird gaming scan
Scan for active gaming sessions on the local network
.TP
.B songbird gaming bridge --game starcraft
Create a bridge for StarCraft gaming sessions
.TP
.B songbird orchestrator start
Start the service orchestrator
.TP
.B songbird config init
Initialize a new configuration file
.TP
.B songbird status
Display current system status

.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/songbird/config.toml
Main configuration file
.TP
.I ~/.config/songbird/networks.toml
Network configuration
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/songbird/logs/
Log files directory

.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SONGBIRD_CONFIG_PATH
Override default configuration file path
.TP
.B SONGBIRD_LOG_LEVEL
Set logging level (error, warn, info, debug, trace)
.TP
.B SONGBIRD_BIND_ADDRESS  
Override default bind address for services

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success
.TP
.B 1
General error
.TP
.B 2
Configuration error
.TP
.B 3
Network error

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR songbird-gaming (1),
.BR songbird-orchestrator (1),
.BR songbird-config (1)

